imiskes</span><span class="cty-y">c. 925–976</span></span></a><span class="cty-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cty-bar pp-life" style="left:41.7%;width:17.0%"></span></span></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/romanos-iii-argyros"><img class="pp-av" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/romanos-iii-argyros.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="pp-nm"><span class="cty-n">Romanos III Argyros</span><span class="cty-y">968–1034</span></span></a><span class="cty-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cty-bar pp-life" style="left:56.0%;width:22.0%"></span></span></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/basil-ii"><img class="pp-av" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/basil-ii.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="pp-nm"><span class="cty-n">Basil II</span><span class="cty-y">r. 976–1025</span></span></a><span class="cty-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cty-bar pp-dim" style="left:58.7%;width:16.3%"></span></span></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/zoe-porphyrogenita"><img class="pp-av" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/zoe-porphyrogenita.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="pp-nm"><span class="cty-n">Zoe Porphyrogenita</span><span class="cty-y">c. 978–1050</span></span></a><span class="cty-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cty-bar pp-life" style="left:59.3%;width:24.0%"></span></span></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/theodora-porphyrogenita"><img class="pp-av" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/theodora-porphyrogenita.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="pp-nm"><span class="cty-n">Theodora Porphyrogenita</span><span class="cty-y">c. 980–1056</span></span></a><span class="cty-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cty-bar pp-life" style="left:60.0%;width:25.3%"></span></span></li></ol><figcaption>9 people of the encyclopedia whose Wikidata record names this house as their family. Bright bars are lifespans; pale bars reigns or years of activity.</figcaption></figure><p class="enc-article-